<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  @page { size: letter; margin: 0.6in; }
  body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Arial, sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a; font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 1.5; }
  h1 { font-size: 15pt; margin: 0 0 4px; }
  h2 { font-size: 11pt; margin: 20px 0 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; padding-bottom: 3px; }
  .header-field { margin: 2px 0; }
  .header-field .label { font-weight: 700; }
  table.fields { border-collapse: collapse; margin: 6px 0 10px; }
  table.fields td { padding: 2px 10px 2px 0; vertical-align: top; }
  table.fields td.label { font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }
  ul { margin: 6px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin-bottom: 4px; }
  p { margin: 6px 0; }
  .sig-block { margin-top: 18px; }
  .sig-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #888; display: inline-block; min-width: 320px; height: 18px; }
  .sig-row { margin: 4px 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>CREW DEAL MEMO / BOOKING CONFIRMATION</h1>
<table class="fields">
  <tr><td class="label">Project Title:</td><td>{{ project.name }}</td></tr>
  {% if project.client_name %}<tr><td class="label">Client:</td><td>{{ project.client_name }}</td></tr>{% endif %}
  {% if project.production_company %}<tr><td class="label">Production Company:</td><td>{{ project.production_company }}</td></tr>{% endif %}
  {% if project.payroll_provider %}<tr><td class="label">Payroll Provider:</td><td>{{ project.payroll_provider }}</td></tr>{% endif %}
  {% if project.location %}<tr><td class="label">Location:</td><td>{{ project.location }}</td></tr>{% endif %}
</table>

<h2>1. Crew Member Information</h2>
<table class="fields">
  <tr><td class="label">Name:</td><td>{{ crew_member.name }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Role/Position:</td><td>{{ crew_member.role or "" }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Phone:</td><td>{{ crew_member.phone or "" }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="label">Email:</td><td>{{ crew_member.email or "" }}</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>2. Engagement &amp; Compensation</h2>
<table class="fields">
  {#- The note keeps its line breaks: "Shoot day rate = … / Travel day rate = …"
      on their own lines, the way the producer's agency memo lays them out. #}
  <tr><td class="label">Rate:</td><td>{{ day_rate or "" }}{% if rate_note %}{% if day_rate %} — {% endif %}{{ rate_note|nl2br }}{% endif %}</td></tr>
  {% if project.per_diem %}<tr><td class="label">Per Diem:</td><td>{{ project.per_diem|nl2br }}</td></tr>{% endif %}
</table>
<p><strong>Dates</strong><br>
{% if crew_member.dates %}{{ crew_member.dates|nl2br }}{% endif %}</p>
<p>Reimbursable Expenses — Need to be pre-approved; reimbursements require receipt documentation.</p>
<p>Payment Terms: Net - within 14 days from payroll submission/production wrap.</p>
<p>Overtime / Additional Hours: Must be pre-approved in writing by the Producer.</p>

<h2>3. Work Expectations</h2>
<p>This is a non-union production unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p>Anticipated workday is approximately 10.5 hours, including a 30-minute meal break.</p>
<p>Meals will be provided in accordance with the production schedule.</p>
<p>Crew agrees to perform services in a professional, safe, and workmanlike manner consistent with industry standards.</p>

<h2>4. Responsibilities</h2>
<p>Crew agrees to:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Follow all on-set safety guidelines, location rules, and production instructions.</li>
  <li>Treat all client, production, and location property with care.</li>
  <li>Maintain confidentiality regarding all non-public project information.</li>
  <li>Promptly report any injury, incident, or damage occurring on set.</li>
</ul>

<h2>5. Employment, Payroll &amp; Insurance Structure</h2>
<p>{{ project.payroll_provider or "The payroll provider" }} is the Employer of Record for W-2 crew and Agent of Record for 1099 crew. Payroll is processed through {{ project.payroll_provider or "the payroll provider" }}, including payment processing, tax withholding, tax reporting (W-2s / 1099s), and workers&rsquo; compensation coverage.</p>
<p>{{ project.production_company or "The Production Company" }} coordinates crew onboarding, scheduling, and production operations and is responsible for transferring funds to {{ project.payroll_provider or "the payroll provider" }}. The Production Company is not the employer of record.</p>
<p>{{ project.production_company or "The Production Company" }} carries the production insurance, including coverage for locations, production equipment rentals, vehicle rentals, and permits as required.</p>

<h2>6. Relationship of the Parties</h2>
<p>The Contractor is an independent contractor and is not an employee of {{ project.production_company or "the Production Company" }} or the Client. Contractor acknowledges and agrees that:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Contractor is responsible for all federal, state, and local taxes, except as required to be withheld and remitted by the Payroll Provider in its role as employer or agent of record.</li>
  <li>Contractor is not entitled to any employee benefits from {{ project.production_company or "the Production Company" }} or the Client, including, without limitation, health insurance, retirement benefits, paid time off, or unemployment benefits.</li>
  <li>Contractor may provide services to other clients and is not exclusively engaged by {{ project.production_company or "the Production Company" }} or the Client.</li>
  <li>Contractor controls the manner and means of performing the services, subject to the project&rsquo;s creative, technical, safety, and scheduling requirements.</li>
  <li>Contractor further acknowledges that payroll processing, tax reporting, and (if applicable) workers&rsquo; compensation coverage is administered solely by the Payroll Provider in its role as employer or agent of record, and that this provision is intended solely to clarify Contractor&rsquo;s relationship with {{ project.production_company or "the Production Company" }} and the Client.</li>
</ul>

<h2>7. Payment</h2>
<p>Payment will be processed through {{ project.payroll_provider or "the Payroll Provider" }}&rsquo;s payroll services. Instructions for invoicing will be sent in a separate email. Payment is contingent upon satisfactory completion of services and receipt of proper documentation.</p>

<h2>8. Cancellation &amp; Changes</h2>
<p>In the event that any confirmed bookings or Work Orders are cancelled or delayed for reasons beyond {{ project.client_name or "the Client" }}&rsquo;s reasonable control, including restrictions or closures mandated or recommended by government, regulatory, or health organizations or officials, {{ project.client_name or "the Client" }} will only be obligated to pay for work actually completed, and no other cancellation fee or penalty shall apply. For any cancellations of confirmed bookings or Work Orders made at {{ project.client_name or "the Client" }}&rsquo;s discretion, {{ project.client_name or "the Client" }} shall pay:</p>
<ul>
  <li>14 - 8 days prior to the scheduled shoot: 50% of the negotiated fee</li>
  <li>7 or fewer days prior to the scheduled shoot: 100% of the negotiated fee</li>
</ul>

<h2>9. No Authority</h2>
<p>Crew has no authority to enter into contracts, make commitments, or bind the Production Company, Payroll Provider, or Client.</p>

<h2>10. Governing Law</h2>
<p>This agreement shall be governed by the laws of the state in which the primary production activity occurs, unless otherwise required by the Client&rsquo;s Terms.</p>

{% if project.client_name %}
<h2>11. Client Terms and Conditions</h2>
<p><strong>{{ project.client_name|upper }} TERMS AND CONDITIONS</strong></p>
<p>CRITICAL REQUIREMENT: This project is for {{ project.client_name }}. You must review and agree to {{ project.client_name }}&rsquo;s Standard Production Terms and Conditions as a condition of this engagement.</p>
<p>Access {{ project.client_name }}&rsquo;s Terms here: ____________________</p>
{% endif %}

<h2>12. Acknowledgment &amp; Signatures</h2>
<p>By signing below, Crew acknowledges that they have read, understand, and agree to the terms of this Deal Memo / Booking Confirmation{% if project.client_name %} and the referenced Client Terms &amp; Conditions{% endif %}.</p>
<ul>
  <li>All terms of this Deal Memo / Booking Confirmation</li>
  {% if project.client_name %}<li>{{ project.client_name }}&rsquo;s Standard Production Terms and Conditions (accessed at the link above)</li>{% endif %}
  <li>Independent contractor status with no employment relationship to {{ project.production_company or "the Production Company" }} or the Client.</li>
</ul>

{% if has_agent %}
<div class="sig-block">
  <p><strong>Agent</strong>{% if agent_name %} — {{ agent_name }}{% endif %}</p>
  <div class="sig-row">Signature: <span class="sig-line"></span></div>
  <div class="sig-row">Name: <span class="sig-line"></span></div>
  <div class="sig-row">Date: <span class="sig-line" style="min-width:140px;"></span></div>
</div>
{% endif %}

<div class="sig-block">
  <p><strong>Crew Member</strong></p>
  <div class="sig-row">Signature: <span class="sig-line"></span></div>
  <div class="sig-row">Name: <span class="sig-line"></span></div>
  <div class="sig-row">Date: <span class="sig-line" style="min-width:140px;"></span></div>
</div>

<div class="sig-block">
  <p><strong>Production Company{% if project.production_company %} — {{ project.production_company }}{% endif %}</strong></p>
  <div class="sig-row">Signature: <span class="sig-line"></span></div>
  <div class="sig-row">Name: <span class="sig-line"></span></div>
  <div class="sig-row">Title: <span class="sig-line"></span></div>
  <div class="sig-row">Date: <span class="sig-line" style="min-width:140px;"></span></div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
